[0.021, "o", "\u001b[2;36H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74;48;2;62;34;30m    28      \u001b[38;2;186;88;72;1m-\u001b[22m- **Send a fully armed knight** — it reads and writes scrolls\u001b[39m  \u001b[3;36H\u001b[38;2;186;88;72m(files), forges patches, scrys with grep and glob, consults the LSP oracles\u001b[39m \u001b[4;36H\u001b[38;2;186;88;72mfor diagnostics, fetches tomes from the far webs, and lights the ritual\u001b[39m     \u001b[5;36H\u001b[38;2;186;88;72mcircle (your shell) when the quest demands.\u001b[39m                                 \u001b[6;36H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74;48;2;34;58;42m         28 \u001b[38;2;138;146;90;1m+\u001b[22m- **Send a fully armed knight** — it reads and writes scrolls\u001b[39m  \u001b[7;36H\u001b[38;2;138;146;90m(files), forges patches, scrys with grep and glob, \u001b[48;2;50;84;58mhunts a half-remembered\u001b[39;48;2;34;58;42m  \u001b[8;34H\u001b[48;2;26;40;30m  \u001b[38;2;138;146;90;48;2;50;84;58mpath with a fuzzy find, \u001b[48;2;34;58;42mconsults the LSP oracles for diagnostics, fetches\u001b[39m   \u001b[48;2;26;40;30m  \u001b[9;34H  \u001b[38;2;138;146;90;48;2;34;58;42mtomes from the far webs, and lights the ritual circle (your shell) when the\u001b[39m \u001b[48;2;26;40;30m  \u001b[10;34H  \u001b[38;2;138;146;90;48;2;34;58;42mquest demands.\u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[48;2;26;40;30m  \u001b[11;36H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74m    29   29 \u001b[38;2;128;120;104;1m \u001b[22m- **Rule by the code of chivalry** — every tool call passes the\u001b[12;36Hpermission wards: allowed, denied, or brought before your seat. A denied\u001b[39m    \u001b[13;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104mincantation cuts the turn; a questionable\u001b[13;78Hon\u001b[13;81H wai\u001b[13;86Hs for your seal.\u001b[39m          \u001b[14;36H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74m    30   30 \u001b[38;2;128;120;104;1m \u001b[22m- **Swear oaths (scenes)** — change the knight's oath\u001b[15;36Hmid-campaign: each scene is a named bundle\u001b[15;79Hof sys\u001b[15;86Hem\u001b[15;89Hprelude, i\u001b[15;100Hjected\u001b[39m      \u001b[16;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104mh\u001b[16;38Hoks, and a \u001b[16;50Hool roster, forged in KDL. Built-in oaths ride along:\u001b[17;36H**Advisor** (advice and planning, read-only), **Revi\u001b[17;89Hwer** (code review\u001b[18;36Hwithout edit\u001b[18;49H), and **Orchestrator** (agent\u001b[18;80Horchestration: d\u001b[18;97Hlegate subtasks\u001b[19;36Hto subagent workers — a planning bench for\u001b[19;79Hd\u001b[19;81Hsign-heavy \u001b[19;93Hopics, the\u001b[39m         \u001b[20;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104mexecution workers for the doing — then verify and integrate) — reshaped\u001b[21;36Hfieldwise in KDL or shadowed by your own.\u001b[22;36H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74m    31   31 \u001b[38;2;128;120;104;1m \u001b[22m- **Gather a party** — worker subagents ride out on their own\u001b[23;34H\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104merrands with their own preambles and tools — scenes can also forge extra\u001b[39m      \u001b[24;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104mmembers (`description` + `toolset`) — or stand down by decree.\u001b[39m                \u001b[25;34H                                                                                \u001b[30;32H\u001b[38;2;212;175;95;49m⣿⣿⣦⡀ ⢀⣴⣿⣿\u001b[30;42H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74mWorking.\u001b[30;52H\u001b[39m \u001b[m\u001b[?25l"]
