[0.021, "o", "\u001b[2;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104;48;2;26;40;30mdiagnostics, fetches tomes from the far webs, and lights the ritual circle\u001b[3;34H\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104m(your shell) when the quest demands.\u001b[39m                                          \u001b[4;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104m+- **Send a fully armed knight** — it reads and writes scrolls (files),\u001b[5;36Hforges patches, scrys with grep and glob, hunts a half-remembered path with\u001b[6;36Ha fuzzy find, consults the LSP oracles for diagnostics, fetches tomes from\u001b[7;36Hthe far webs, and lights the ritual circle (your shell) when the quest\u001b[8;36Hdemands.\u001b[39m                                                   \u001b[9;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104m - **Rule by th\u001b[9;52H code of chival\u001b[9;68Hy** — every tool call passes the permission\u001b[10;36Hwards:\u001b[10;43Hallowed, denied, or brought befo\u001b[10;76He your seat. A denied incantation\u001b[11;36Hcuts the turn; a questi\u001b[11;60Hnable one\u001b[11;70Hwaits for your s\u001b[11;87Hal.\u001b[39m            \u001b[12;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104m - **Swear oaths (scenes)** —\u001b[12;66Hchange the knight's oath mid-campaign:\u001b[12;105Heach\u001b[39m  \u001b[13;36H\u001b[38;2;128;120;104mscene is a named bundle of system prelude, injected hooks, and a tool\u001b[14;36Hroster, forged in KDL. Built-in oaths ride along: **Advisor** (advice and\u001b[15;36Hplanning, read-only), **Reviewer** (code review without edits), and\u001b[16;34H\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104m**Orchestrator** (agent orchestration: delegate subtasks to subagent workers\u001b[39m  \u001b[17;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104m— a planning bench for design-heavy topics, the execution workers for the\u001b[39m     \u001b[18;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104mdoing — then verify and integrate) — reshaped fieldwise in KDL or shadowed\u001b[39m    \u001b[19;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104mby your own.\u001b[39m                                                                  \u001b[20;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104m - **Gather a party** — worker subagents ride out on their own errands with\u001b[39m   \u001b[21;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104mtheir own preambles and tools — scenes can also forge extra members\u001b[39m           \u001b[22;34H  \u001b[38;2;128;120;104m(`description` + `toolset`) — or stand down by decree.\u001b[39m                        \u001b[23;34H  \u001b[38;2;92;86;74;3m… +14 more lines\u001b[39;23m                                                              \u001b[24;34H  \u001b[38;2;92;86;74;3m  Took 0.0s\u001b[39;23m                                                                   \u001b[25;34H                                                                                \u001b[30;42H\u001b[38;2;92;86;74;49mWork\u001b[30;49H...\u001b[39m             \u001b[m\u001b[?25l"]
